      "text": "1",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "xeqMN",
      "text": "2",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{f}(\\mathrm{x})=4 \\cos ^3(\\mathrm{x})+3 \\sqrt{3} \\cos ^2(\\mathrm{x})-10 ; \\mathrm{x} \\in(0,2 \\pi) \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{f}^{\\prime}(\\mathrm{x})=12 \\cos ^2 \\mathrm{x}[-\\sin (\\mathrm{x})]+3 \\sqrt{3}(2 \\cos (\\mathrm{x}))[-\\sin (\\mathrm{x})] \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{f}^{\\prime}(\\mathrm{x})=-6 \\sin (\\mathrm{x}) \\cos (\\mathrm{x})[2 \\cos (\\mathrm{x})+\\sqrt{3}]\\end{aligned}$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/BmAPFOFz4I5_2lxF_bzrQXlVrv8fQ2qVcN1H4g4ZYOs.original.fullsize.png\"><br />local maxima at $\\mathrm{x}=\\frac{5 \\pi}{6}, \\frac{7 \\pi}{6}$",
    "image": null
  },
